  "description": "Tough, durable, edgy, and here for a good time, we fused our favorite elements of mountain bike culture, beach cruiser comfort, and the sentimentality of youth in our newest ride: Sully. Steel moto-style handlebars, BMX Alloy threadless stem, knobby tires, a comfortable saddle, and gritty detailing make Sully unrivaled in style and ride.\n\nOur nod to Klunker bikes of the past features a hand-built, high-tensile steel frame, and unicrown fork. Unique BMX-style handlebars, Promax linear pull rear brakes, Kenda K-Rad 26” multi-purpose tires, and a gritty, down to earth build will have you conquering backroads and coasting down bike paths. Sully is your childhood dream bike, and your feet can finally reach the pedals.\n\nSully is your childhood dream bike, and your feet can finally reach the pedals.\n\n*Due to differences in screen resolutions, please note that colors may differ slightly.",
